  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Ratio — Innate Technique (6th level)</em></p><p>When you reach 6th level, as an action for 4 Cursed Energy, you make an attack to destroy the ground around you in a 30 ft circle, applying your critical hit to the rubble. The area becomes difficult terrain and every creature in the area must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failure, they take your attack’s damage + 3d10 bludgeoning damage. On a success, they take half as much damage. <br />\n You now roll 3 additional damage dice on a critical hit.</p>",
